Le vendredi 28 juillet 2017 17:51:56 UTC+2, Adam Lopresto a =C3=A9crit :
>
> jbovlaste should already be filtered to contain only Lojban, and there=20
> are, broadly, three types of Lojban words:
> cmevla are everything that ends in a consonant
> brivla all contain a consonant cluster and end in a vowel
> cmavo optionally start with a single consonant, and consist entirely of=
=20
> vowels and apostrophes after that.
>
> So, I think you could filter all cmavo clusters by looking for anything=
=20
> that matches /.+[^aeiou'].*[aeiou]/ but doesn't match /[^aeiou'][^aeiou']=
/.=20
> Contains a non-vowel somewhere after the first letter, ends in a vowel, a=
nd=20
> doesn't contain a consonant cluster.
>
> At least, that seems like a good start.=20
>

